---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us — Carouseln" description="Learn about Carouseln, the neobrutalist AI carousel builder designed to make social media content creation instant and consistent.">
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-[var(--color-bg)] pt-32 pb-20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
      
      <!-- Hero Header -->
      <div class="mb-12">
        <div class="inline-block bg-[var(--color-gold)] text-black px-4 py-1 border-2 border-black font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sm mb-4 shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_#000]">
          Our Mission
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-[48px] md:text-[64px] font-display font-medium text-[var(--color-text-primary)] leading-tight mb-4 uppercase">
          We build tools for the new era of creators
        </h1>
        <p class="text-[18px] md:text-[20px] font-ui text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
          Carouseln was born out of a simple frustration: design tools are too slow, and social media templates are too inconsistent. We created a platform that remembers your brand DNA so you can generate slides in seconds.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Main About Box -->
      <div class="bg-[var(--color-surface)] border-4 border-black p-8 md:p-12 shadow-[8px_8px_0px_0px_#000] mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-[32px] font-display font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mt-0 mb-6 uppercase pb-4 border-b-2 border-[var(--color-border)]">
          The Carouseln Philosophy
        </h2>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-10">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-[20px] font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mb-3 uppercase flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-3 h-3 bg-[var(--color-gold)] border border-black shrink-0"></span>
              Brand DNA Engine
            </h3>
            <p class="text-[16px] font-ui text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
              Your style guidelines shouldn't live in a PDF. Carouseln saves your brand colors, typography, logos, and layouts directly in the schema, applying it dynamically to every slide generated by our AI.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-[20px] font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mb-3 uppercase flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-3 h-3 bg-[var(--color-cyan)] border border-black shrink-0"></span>
              Brutal Speed
            </h3>
            <p class="text-[16px] font-ui text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
              No canvas drag-and-drop fatigue. Write your topic, let the AI generate the carousel copy, review the design variants, and export. High-converting content in less than 2 minutes.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-[32px] font-display font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mt-10 mb-6 uppercase pb-4 border-b-2 border-[var(--color-border)]">
          Who We Are
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[16px] font-ui text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Carouseln is designed and engineered by <strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Asenra</strong>. We are a collective of product builders, designers, and developers building high-performance software for digital operators.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[16px] font-ui text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed mb-0">
          We believe in software that has a point of view—embracing bold layouts, strong typography, high contrast, and zero fluff. That's why we built Carouseln using modern neobrutalist design patterns.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Call to Action Card -->
      <div class="bg-[var(--color-surface-2)] border-4 border-black p-8 text-center shadow-[6px_6px_0px_0px_#000]">
        <h3 class="text-[28px] font-display font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mb-4 uppercase">
          Ready to supercharge your content?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[16px] font-ui text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto">
          Start generating beautiful, brand-aligned carousels for Instagram, LinkedIn, and Facebook in minutes.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center items-center gap-4">
          <a href="/signup" class="no-underline">
            <button class="bg-[var(--color-gold)] text-black border-4 border-black px-8 py-3 font-black text-[14px] uppercase tracking-wide shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_#000] hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[6px_6px_0px_0px_#000] active:translate-y-0.5 active:shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_#000] transition-all duration-150 ease-out cursor-pointer">
              Get Started Free
            </button>
          </a>
          <a href="/login" class="no-underline">
            <button class="bg-white text-black border-4 border-black px-8 py-3 font-black text-[14px] uppercase tracking-wide shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_#000] hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[6px_6px_0px_0px_#000] active:translate-y-0.5 active:shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_#000] transition-all duration-150 ease-out cursor-pointer">
              Sign In
            </button>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
